{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29207/", "pk": 29207, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/", "pk": 8883, "shortname": "getawayadventures", "name": "Getaway Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Calistoga Sip N' Cycle", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 0, "unicode": "Calistoga Sip N' Cycle", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 24.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": true, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "#Our most popular Sip ‘N Cycle takes you through the quiet and scenic northern Napa Valley. \n\n##Rates\n • **Adult** $250 *Ages 16 and up*\n • **Child/Teen** $200 *Ages <15*\n\n##Time\n **10:30AM - 3:00PM**\n\n##About\n\nCycle along famous vineyards and try world-renowned Napa wines while enjoying stunning valley views. Our most popular tour! This takes in the best of the best in the Napa Valley. We bike to 2 wineries, all unique in their own way, along the quiet back roads of Calistoga. We’ll stop in and get a “Grapes 101” along the way, pop in and taste wines and learn a lot about how to sip, swirl, and taste all the wines. Your guides act as a chef, wine educator, concierge, confidant and Sherpa all wrapped up in one. We then prepare a delicious wine country picnic lunch at one of the wineries. All in all we’ll travel 12 miles along mostly flat roads.\n\n\n##Meeting Location\n• **Logvy Community Park**\n**[1745 Washington st, Calistoga]**\n\n\n##Includes\n • **Use of Town bike and helmet, unlimited water, Wine Country picnic lunch, and professional local guides.**\n\n\n##Wineries we may visit\n • **Chateau Montelena, Bennett Lane , Envy, Summers, Lava Vine, August Briggs, Tedeschi, Twomey, T Vine and Clos Pegase, among others.**", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Logvy Community Park, Calistoga, CA", "booking_notes": "#Meeting Location\n• **Logvy Community Park/Calistoga Community Pool, 1745 Washington St, Calistoga, CA 94515**\n\n\n#Includes\n • **Use of regular pedal bike or, if chosen, E-bike and helmet, unlimited water, lunch, and [professional local guides](http://getawayadventures.com/about/team/) .**\n\n• **Does not include wine tasting fees ($25 to $40 per winery) or Guide Gratuity at your discretion,  as a guideline we suggest 10-20%**\n\n#Contact\n**Please call if you have any questions**\n• **M-F: 9:30-5:30 - 1-800-499-2453\n   After Hours/Weekends - 1-707-753-0866**", "cancellation_notes": "Getaway Adventures charges the full balance at the time of booking with a $25 per person non-refundable deposit, included in the price. Any cancellations made more than 3 days prior to the tour will be refunded the balance of their tour, less the $25 per person deposit. Any cancellations made within 3 days of the tour will be charged the full tour price, but a voucher for the full price will be issued and may be used towards any future tour.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "From $250 • 4.5 Hours • Cycle along famous vineyards and try world-renowned Napa wines • All ages!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/compani